#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:5 aced82fef2d541858e0596aaa1657a05
msgid "Elevon Planes"
msgstr "升降副翼飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:10
#: e19d96c9985244c4aab13666e1ddfd70
msgid ""
"Elevon planes (also known as delta-wings) are popular for their simplicity "
"and robustness."
msgstr "升降副翼飞机（又称三角翼）以其简单性和坚固性而广受欢迎。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:13
#: 8f3f4d7e88814ab489a201243d7bb9a2
msgid ""
"A typical elevon plane will have 2 servo outputs and one throttle output."
msgstr "典型的升降副翼飞机有 2 个舵机输出和 1 个油门输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:17
#: dcd9d58d661843e6bb0e00e35749ce11
msgid "Setting Up Your Plane"
msgstr "设置您的飞机"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:19
#: 250d5a74007a4015bf1a93165043353a
msgid "The recommended setup for APM:Plane with elevon planes is:"
msgstr "ArduPlane 搭配升降副翼飞机的推荐设置如下："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:30
#: d11093a1a38a4a5eb45ea2375079a043
msgid ""
"You should remove the propeller from your aircraft before starting your "
"setup."
msgstr "开始设置前应先卸下飞机上的螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:34
#: aa878016efdb49c1880e393a20f72d30
msgid "RC Input Setup & Reversal"
msgstr "RC 输入设置与反向"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:36
#: 9da0aeef2cf5436faca9522290736e1c
msgid ""
"Set up your :ref:`RC inputs <rc-throw-trim>` through the calibration "
"process, and verify them for reversal. Reversals are critical to the "
"process. Commanding pitch up and roll right must result in higher PWM values"
" for RCn_in channels. If the value does not respond correctly reverse the "
"channel before continuing."
msgstr ""
"通过校准流程设置 :ref:`RC 输入 <rc-throw-trim>`，并验证反向设置。反向设置对整个流程至关重要。命令俯仰上升和向右横滚必须导致 "
"RCn_in 通道的 PWM 值升高。若响应不正确，请先反向该通道再继续。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:42
#: c72e3a043f2f40ab9b0e47b49b2cdf2f
msgid ""
"You can connect your 3 servo cables to any output of your autopilot, "
"although using the defaults listed above is recommended."
msgstr "可将 3 根舵机线连接到飞控的任意输出，但建议使用上述默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:46
#: 1de49c3d6b70453c862619ae2124eb27
msgid "Servo Setup & Reversal"
msgstr "舵机设置与反向"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:48
#: 5160bad014f646b6b60744a1fa9fd52c
msgid ""
"The next step is to get the servo reversals right. You should connect the "
"battery (with propeller removed) and turn on your RC transmitter. Now switch"
" to FBWA mode and press the safety switch (if fitted) to enable servo "
"outputs."
msgstr "下一步是正确设置舵机反向。接上电池（已卸下螺旋桨），打开遥控器，切换到 FBWA 模式，按下安全开关（如已安装）以启用舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:53
#: 43c274254fdf4ba59c101762f75ba621
msgid ""
"At this point both the autopilot and RC transmitter should have control of "
"the elevons. You now should adjust the reversal and function of the two "
"servos so that you get correct movement."
msgstr "此时飞控和遥控器均应对升降副翼有控制权。现在调整两个舵机的反向和功能，以获得正确的运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:57
#: 0da78faa36b44be19e0127642d2e5037
msgid ""
"Correct FBWA (automatic stabilization)movement for an elevon plane WITHOUT "
"PROVIDING RC INPUT is:"
msgstr "在不提供 RC 输入的情况下，升降副翼飞机正确的 FBWA（自动稳定）运动为："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:70
#: 73d38bea264f40ac9273e5db3b5c57a4
msgid ""
"If your movements are incorrect then you need to adjust which servo output "
"is left/right and the reversals of each elevon."
msgstr "若运动不正确，需调整左/右舵机输出及各升降副翼的反向设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:73
#: 00a9ac85f55147458570ee097f14f5c3
msgid ""
"The parameters you should adjust are "
":ref:`SERVO1_REVERSED<SERVO1_REVERSED>`, "
":ref:`SERVO2_REVERSED<SERVO2_REVERSED>`, "
":ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION<SERVO1_FUNCTION>` and "
":ref:`SERVO2_FUNCTION<SERVO2_FUNCTION>`."
msgstr ""
"需要调整的参数为 "
":ref:`SERVO1_REVERSED<SERVO1_REVERSED>`、:ref:`SERVO2_REVERSED<SERVO2_REVERSED>`、:ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION<SERVO1_FUNCTION>`"
" 和 :ref:`SERVO2_FUNCTION<SERVO2_FUNCTION>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:76
#: a9001ea71b3d4cdc9cefdace88325cf8
msgid ""
"If your left elevon on servo 1 is moving the wrong way for both pitch and "
"roll corrections, set :ref:`SERVO1_REVERSED<SERVO1_REVERSED>` to 1."
msgstr ""
"若舵机 1 上的左升降副翼在俯仰和横滚修正中均运动方向错误，将 :ref:`SERVO1_REVERSED<SERVO1_REVERSED>` 设为 "
"1。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:79
#: 199ef6443f474d20ac340baaa4bf9643
msgid ""
"If your left elevon on servo 1 responds correctly to pitch, but incorrectly "
"to roll, change the :ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION<SERVO1_FUNCTION>`."
msgstr ""
"若舵机 1 上的左升降副翼俯仰响应正确但横滚响应错误，更改 :ref:`SERVO1_FUNCTION<SERVO1_FUNCTION>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:82
#: 1e287bcaa2cc4ee1829ccb3cc40d1429
msgid "Repeat the servo reversal or function change for the right elevon."
msgstr "对右侧升降副翼重复舵机反向或功能更改操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:84
#: cbc371dcaee24559a06ccc3b0af88998
msgid ""
"In rare instances, both servo 1 and 2 will individually respond correctly "
"with the same FUNCTION. This is OK."
msgstr "在极少数情况下，舵机 1 和 2 都以相同的 FUNCTION 各自正确响应，这是正常的。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:87
#: 511c4678c7f3485dbd8cb81899f7e493
msgid ""
"while rolling the aircraft the autopilot will automatically try to put in "
"some up pitch, as it knows that upward pitch is needed in turns. So you will"
" probably see an asymmetry in elevon movement. The elevon that is going down"
" will not go down very far, or (depending on your settings) may not go down "
"at all."
msgstr ""
"横滚飞机时，飞控会自动尝试施加一些上仰俯仰，因为它知道转弯时需要向上俯仰。因此升降副翼运动可能出现不对称：向下运动的升降副翼行程可能不大，甚至（取决于设置）完全不向下运动。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:95
#: 65932a76caf14718a42c30a16dede610
msgid "Verify RC Inputs"
msgstr "验证 RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:97
#: 57a909eb422142f9a9f20111177fe250
msgid ""
"Now that the elevons are configured correctly, verify your RC inputs. In "
"FBWA with the airplane level, command pitch-up from your transmitter and "
"confirm that the elevons both rise. Command a roll to the right from your "
"transmitter and confirm that the right elevon rises and the left elevon "
"lowers. If this is incorrect, read the :ref:`RC inputs <rc-throw-trim>` page"
" to fix your rc"
msgstr ""
"升降副翼配置正确后，验证 RC 输入。在 FBWA "
"模式下将飞机保持水平，从遥控器发出俯仰上升指令，确认两个升降副翼均上翘。从遥控器发出向右横滚指令，确认右侧升降副翼上翘、左侧下压。若不正确，请阅读 "
":ref:`RC 输入 <rc-throw-trim>` 页面修正遥控设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:104
#: cfe03438f7c34e5c86f4f97dc79564d1
msgid "Switch the plane to MANUAL mode and confirm the same behavior."
msgstr "将飞机切换到 MANUAL 模式并确认相同的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:107
#: d1fe33f14fb2497b97849f84b2ace866
msgid "Servo Trim"
msgstr "舵机配平"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:109
#: 71d484110e3f473392f4dc18492f5212
msgid ""
"Now stay in MANUAL mode in order to adjust the servo trim values. The servo "
"trim is in the SERVOn_TRIM parameters."
msgstr "保持在 MANUAL 模式以调整舵机配平值，舵机配平位于 SERVOn_TRIM 参数中。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:112
#: c3281508748e482687240d54ef2c87c2
msgid ""
"You should adjust the trim values so that the servo is centered when your "
"transmitter sticks are centered. If you find you need to adjust the trim "
"value by more than 50 PWM from the default of 1500 then it is recommended "
"that you instead adjust the trim mechanically."
msgstr "应调整配平值，使遥控器摇杆居中时舵机也处于中立位置。若发现需要从默认值 1500 调整超过 50 个 PWM，建议改为进行机械调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:118
#: 448a69ee652546b3b8882fb63d4d4912
msgid "Servo Throw"
msgstr "舵机行程"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:120
#: f6bf9fa069694f078ef17ea1519a0e8c
msgid ""
"Finally you should adjust your servo throw. The throw is the range of "
"movement for each of your servos."
msgstr "最后调整舵机行程，即每个舵机的运动范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:123
#: e06a743557d8405cb964ec11c379c16c
msgid ""
"Check any instructions that came with your plane for suggested throw values."
" These are often specified in millimeters or inches of movement of the edge "
"of the control surface. If your aircraft doesn't come with any suggested "
"throw values then choose a throw that doesn't cause your servos to \"bind\" "
"(which is indicated by a high pitched sound when your servos move too far)."
msgstr ""
"查阅飞机附带的说明书获取建议行程值，通常以操纵面边缘的运动毫米数或英寸数表示。若飞机没有建议行程值，则选择一个不会导致舵机「卡死」的行程（卡死通常表现为舵机运动过度时发出高音蜂鸣声）。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:130
#: c0de522d547640a0b6b32423a7d42a32
msgid ""
"To adjust the throw, change the SERVOn_MIN and SERVOn_MAX values. The "
"defaults are 1100 to 1900. On many aircraft you will want more throw than "
"that, and can change to a throw of 1000 to 2000."
msgstr ""
"调整行程时，更改 SERVOn_MIN 和 SERVOn_MAX 值。默认值为 1100 至 1900。许多飞机需要更大的行程，可将其改为 1000 至"
" 2000。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:135
#: 165f6688fb6348e598b1848091441360
msgid "Mixing Gain"
msgstr "混控增益"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:137
#: 089f62dd88084c88bc402ca4d1902378
msgid ""
"The :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` parameter is critical for elevon "
"aircraft. It is the gain used in mixing between roll and pitch input and "
"your elevon movement."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` 参数对升降副翼飞机至关重要，它是横滚与俯仰输入混控到升降副翼运动时使用的增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:141
#: a82c0d23963c44c4a9aed9200782d592
msgid ""
"For example, if your :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` is 0.5, then the "
"following outputs are used:"
msgstr "例如，若 :ref:`MIXING_GAIN<MIXING_GAIN>` 为 0.5，则使用以下输出计算："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:144
#: 949f80ea5b7a467da84051bc56ac7ea4
msgid "LEFT ELEVON = (roll+pitch)*0.5"
msgstr "LEFT ELEVON = (roll+pitch)*0.5"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:145
#: 2b82ec539c7649f39e3d4d3a681d0798
msgid "RIGHT ELEVON = (roll-pitch)*0.5"
msgstr "RIGHT ELEVON = (roll-pitch)*0.5"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:147
#: b01479b4cc1d4ba3b360e802202222cf
msgid ""
"So, simultaneous full roll and  full pitch input will result in maximum "
"travel of the elevons if mixing gain is 0.5. But if just full roll or pitch "
"is input, maximum elevon deflection would be only 50%."
msgstr "因此，当混控增益为 0.5 时，同时满输入横滚和俯仰将使升降副翼达到最大行程。但若仅输入满横滚或满俯仰，升降副翼偏转量只有 50%。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:149
#: e3899094cb654a589f233996359e9a97
msgid ""
"If more deflection is desired when using only one control input, the mixing "
"gain can be increased. However, with gains above 0.5, surface deflection "
"will be saturated at some point when both inputs are simultaneously applied."
" For example, if you use a gain of 1.0, and apply full roll, you will obtain"
" the maximum elevon deflection possible to produce roll. But then adding in "
"pitch while holding full roll input, will reduce the effective roll "
"deflection because one elevon deflection is already saturated."
msgstr ""
"若希望仅使用一个控制输入时获得更大偏转，可提高混控增益。但增益超过 0.5 时，同时施加两个输入会在某一点导致舵面饱和。例如，若增益为 1.0 "
"并施加满横滚，将获得最大升降副翼偏转以产生横滚；但同时加入俯仰时，由于某一升降副翼已饱和，有效横滚偏转将减小。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:152
#: c41825f091b94e8db452061f4d439e6b
msgid "Mixing Offset"
msgstr "混控偏移"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:154
#: 372eca7e37bc4ab4983eb0cccacdc1f6
msgid ""
"The :ref:`MIXING_OFFSET<MIXING_OFFSET>` parameter allows increasing the "
"sensitivity of either roll or pitch inputs by effectively multiplying the "
"stick input. A value between -1000 and +1000 can be used, with 0 having no "
"effect."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MIXING_OFFSET<MIXING_OFFSET>` 参数通过有效倍增摇杆输入，允许提高横滚或俯仰输入的灵敏度。可使用 -1000 至"
" +1000 之间的值，0 表示无效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:156
#: 0c4b7c91ff364b949fd2dc5f1ddc447a
msgid ""
"If a negative value is used, the pitch input is multiplied, while the roll "
"input is unaffected. If  positive, only roll is affected."
msgstr "若使用负值，俯仰输入被倍增，横滚输入不受影响；若使用正值，仅横滚受影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:158
#: d5da3a83256146e9914d1637bf72f698
msgid "The amount the stick input value is multiplied is given by:"
msgstr "摇杆输入值的倍增量计算公式为："

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:160
#: 58afe465da334507bcb82d990b9e1911
msgid "Multiplier in % = 100 + | :ref:`MIXING_OFFSET<MIXING_OFFSET>` |"
msgstr "倍增量（%）= 100 + | :ref:`MIXING_OFFSET<MIXING_OFFSET>` |"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:162
#: 7f9dbf7200a249809c68eec67a701d75
msgid ""
"So, if :ref:`MIXING_OFFSET<MIXING_OFFSET>` = 100 then roll inputs will be "
"multiplied by 2...so when the aileron stick is deflected halfway, full throw"
" will be effectively input.CAUTION: Roll stick inputs above half will have "
"no further effect."
msgstr ""
"因此，若 :ref:`MIXING_OFFSET<MIXING_OFFSET>` = 100，横滚输入将被乘以 "
"2——即副翼摇杆偏转一半时，将有效输入满行程。注意：超过一半的横滚摇杆输入将不再有进一步效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:167
#: 0c1684f9175f4b08af3e6bf40ffaf669
msgid "Final Setup"
msgstr "最终设置"

#: ../../source/docs/guide-elevon-plane.rst:169
#: 9d3e7504a0c14554adbf42b6ec7eb06e
msgid ""
"After completing the above you should move onto the final setup of your "
"aircraft."
msgstr "完成以上步骤后，继续进行飞机的最终设置。"

